# --- ADDED TO REDUCE ARCHIVE SIZE --- #
# Aggressive Glob Ignores for Monorepo
# We only ignore specific directories that are NOT needed for the build.
# For example, when building customer, we don't necessarily need admin or driver.
# However, to avoid complexity, we'll keep it simple and just ignore large subfolders.

# Massive Build Folders (Especially Admin Next.js)
**/.next/**
**/out/**
**/build/**
**/dist/**

# Root-level Massive Folders
**/e2e/**
**/dist_test/**
**/docs/**
**/supabase/**
**/tests/**
**/testsprite_tests/**
**/public-key/**
**/cashfree-mcp/**

# Redundant Ignores for Reliability
**/.idea/**
**/.vscode/**
**/.git/**
**/android_backup/**
**/node_modules_backup/**

